      "title": "常对角元与常非对角元矩阵的高次幂",
      "stem": "设 $A$ 为 $n$ 阶矩阵，其对角元均为 $2$，非对角元均为 $1$。求 $A^{2024}$。",
      "question_type": "calculation",
      "difficulty_level": 2,
      "answers": [
        {
          "answer_type": "symbolic",
          "answer_text": "记 $J=\\mathbf 1\\mathbf 1^T$ 为全 $1$ 矩阵，则\n$$A^{2024}=I_n+\\frac{(n+1)^{2024}-1}{n}J.$$",
          "is_primary": true
        }
      ],
      "solutions": [
        {
          "title": "按两个特征子空间作投影分解",
          "solution_type": "teaching",
          "text": "有 $A=I_n+J$ 且 $J^2=nJ$。在 $\\operatorname{span}\\{\\mathbf1\\}$ 上，$J$ 的特征值为 $n$；在 $\\mathbf1^\\perp$ 上为 $0$，所以 $A$ 的对应特征值为 $n+1$ 与 $1$。两个投影分别为 $J/n$ 与 $I_n-J/n$。因此 $A^{2024}=(n+1)^{2024}J/n+(I_n-J/n)$，化简即得答案。",
          "main_method_code": "spectral_projector_power",
          "is_primary": true,
          "steps": [
            {
              "order": 1,
              "role": "transform",
              "text": "写成 $A=I_n+J$，其中 $J$ 为全 $1$ 矩阵。"
            },
            {
              "order": 2,
              "role": "understand_problem",
              "text": "识别 $\\operatorname{span}\\{\\mathbf1\\}$ 与 $\\mathbf1^\\perp$ 为不变子空间，$A$ 在其上的特征值分别为 $n+1$ 和 $1$。",
              "knowledge_point_code": "eigenspace_decomposition"
            },
            {
              "order": 3,
              "role": "apply_method",
              "text": "使用投影 $J/n$ 与 $I_n-J/n$ 对幂进行谱计算。",
              "method_code": "spectral_projector_power"
            },
            {
              "order": 4,
              "role": "conclude",
              "text": "得到 $A^{2024}=I_n+((n+1)^{2024}-1)J/n$。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
