              "role": "understand_problem",
              "text": "每行的映射 $x\\mapsto xA$ 的像维数等于 $\\operatorname{rank}A=r$。",
              "knowledge_point_code": "image_and_rank"
            },
            {
              "order": 3,
              "role": "compute",
              "text": "对 $m$ 个相互独立的行位置求维数和，得到 $mr$。",
              "method_code": "dimension_counting"
            }
          ]
